  "ruleText": "Fam 101.01 Purpose. These rules implement the statutory responsibilities of the New Hampshire board of family mediator certification created by RSA 328-C:4.\n\nSource. #5609, eff 4-6-93, EXPIRED: 4-6-99\n\nNew. #7716, INTERIM, eff 6-22-02, EXPIRED: 12-19-02\n\nNew. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10",
